//RS     // when the receiver is a type name in `cx.type_names` (Expression.rs ~L1644). We
//RS     // reproduce exactly that, and only that: the receiver is a bare type-name ident
//RS     // (not a local), the type is a covered struct/enum, the method is a registered
//RS     // user method (in `method_sigs`) that is NOT an enum *variant* (those emit an enum
//RS     // literal, a different lowering) and NOT a builtin/special intercept.
