//RS /// user method)? Returns the field's `Type::Fn` when so. `recv_type` is the total sema
//RS /// fact (`Some(<StructType>)`, set by CheckerInfer's fn-field arm); the field must exist
//RS /// on a COVERED struct with a `Type::Fn` type and the same name as `method`. Mirrors the
