//RS /// c109 Phase 27: is `w.step(4)` (a call through a fn-typed struct field) in-subset? The
//RS /// receiver and every arg must be in-subset; args are emitted PLAINLY by the AST path
//RS /// (`emit_call_args(.., None, ..)`), so no convention/Arc-clone fact applies — exclude any
//RS /// labeled / Arc-clone arg defensively (sema never produces them here, but stay strict).
//RS pub(crate) fn fn_field_call_in_subset(
